today we will be explaining all of  nezuko's forms in demon slayer we will  start with her human form and in the  later parts of the video we'll explain  her most powerful demonic forms we all  know nezuko as tonjiro's younger sister  and one of the main characters in the  show she is also one of the most unique  characters in the entire demon slayer  world while spending most of the time  hidden in a specially made box she would  often be very helpful and save tonjero's  life on many occasions but before  becoming the powerful demon she is today  she was once a regular human while we  don't know much about her human life we  know for certain that she was a good and  caring person nezuko grew up on a  mountain alongside her older brother  tonjiro the rest of her siblings and her  mother as the eldest daughter of the  commodo family she presumably took care  of her younger siblings as an assistant  to her mother as is briefly witnessed  prior to her family's death unlike  tangero who was responsible for selling  firewood in town nezuko would usually  help out around the family home after  the demon king muzan kibutsuji found and  attacked the comodo family while tantro  was out in the village nezuko was the  only one left alive she was then turned  into a demon by muzon's blood now things  are getting interesting keep watching so  you don't miss some of her most powerful  forms number 4. demon form as a demon  nezuko seems to have forgotten a good  portion of her memories as a human  besides those related to her family and  thus doesn't retain the exact  personality she had before the  transformation as soon as she regained  her consciousness as a demon she  attacked her brother tanjro who was  carrying her on his back soon after she  recognized her brother and started  crying proving that she still possesses  her human side when giyu tamayoka  charged towards tonjiro she jumped in to  protect him showing you and everyone  else that she is a different type of  demon giu realized this and decided not  to slay nezuko but instead send her and  tanjuro to his former teacher tsukonji  urukudaki as the chosen demon nezuko has  several unique demonic traits that set  her apart from all other demons most  notably nezuko can continuously restore  her power without consuming any humans  like all other demons would need to do  instead she recovers her strength  through sleep alone though she would  have to spend a lot of time sleeping in  order to recuperate and regain her power  upon being transformed into a demon  nezuko displayed the basic ability to  change and alter her body's size and  height she was able to shrink herself  into the physical size of a small child  in order to fit inside a small box or a  basket in order to hide from sunlight  during the night if her brother needed  any help she would often enlarge herself  into a much bigger form in order to be  able to battle against demons number 3  demon combat form as a demon nezuko  possesses naturally enhanced physical  strength even at the start of the series  when she first became a demon she was  strong enough to decapitate another  demon with a single kick her most  prominent trait is her extraordinary  growth rate possibly due to the high  amount of blood she received from muzon  and the fact that she doesn't need to  consume humans to stay alive nezuko  punched the swamp demon so hard that he  coughed up blood even overwhelming the  demon with powerful punches and kicks as  she has no combat experience nezuku  relies on brute strength using her legs  as her main weapon to deliver fast and  strong kicks this was shown across many  battles during the course of the series  where she would defeat her enemies  despite being overwhelmed by them in the  beginning neziko is often seen using her  extraordinary growth technique in the  middle of the battle gaining incredible  power boosts this is best exemplified  during her battle against susumaru where  her foot was blown by the demon's ball  attack but after regenerating she was  able to face her in an even match  kicking the ball and eventually  surpassing her she has been shown to  defeat her enemies by increasing her own  physical capabilities enhancing her  regeneration or developing her own blood  demon art in dire situations her  self-made blood demon art is called  pyrokinesis it allows her to generate  and manipulate special demonic flames  created from her blood nezuko can do  this by igniting her blood or creating  it from thin air her flames have a  special property that makes them only  harmful to demons and objects of demon  origin while being completely harmless  to humans and other objects this was  shown when her fire could burn rui's  threads and moo's dream spell and  genya's demon form but was unable to  affect tandro and the mugen train her  flames have been noted to hamper the  regeneration of demons to an extent as  shown with daki being temporarily unable  to regenerate from being burned by her  flames nezuko has shown to be quite  proficient in using her blood demon art  from setting demons on fire to enhance  the potency of her attacks burning off  gyeo taro's poison to save enosuke and  tenjin and turning tanjaro's nichiren  sword bright red which gave him a much  needed advantage against tantangu's  clones number 2 awakened form nezuko's  awakened form is her most powerful  combat form she has the ability to enter  into a berserk state where she becomes  more demonic in appearance transforming  into an adult version of herself with  vine like tattoos that circle her body  and a horn protruding from her right  forehead side this awakened form greatly  enhances nezuku's physical capabilities  as well as increases her regeneration  level to match that of the upper ranked  demon at the cost of her needing to feed  on human blood the first time nezuku  uses her awakened form is against upper  rank six ducky when transformed the mere  pressure emanating off of her made doki  afraid for her life with no hesitation  nizuko dashes towards the upper rank and  delivers a powerful downward kick daki  in response cuts her leg and tries to  behead her however nezuko still lands a  solid blow on doki's back smashing her  into the ground this comes as a surprise  to donkey as to how did a disembodied  leg still land a kick to which she  discovered that as she cut nazuku's leg  it regenerated quick enough for her to  still attack thus making her admit that  nezuko's regeneration surpassed hers  completely daki cuts all of nezuko's  body with her sashes while nezuko's  right arm catches one of them despite  being severed from her body she realizes  that nezuko solidified her own blood in  order to stop the impact from her sash  without daki realizing it nezuko  converts her solidified blood into her  blood demon art and engulfs docky with  crimson red flames  as the upper rank continues to burn and  scream from anguish and terror nezuko  reassembles her amputated limbs and her  head giving off a sadistic smile and  stomps docky's head into the ground  despite usually being able to control  her bloodlust in this form it seems that  nezuko has a hard time doing that after  seeing human blood due to her  transformation drastically increasing  her demonic instincts she quickly dashes  at the woman to eat her and consume her  blood tanjuro springs to action and  stops nizuko by restraining her body  with his legs and covering her mouth  with his nichiren sword jaki reappears  with the right side of her body  including her face badly burned from  nezuko's blood demon art on top of this  despite being a demon specifically an  upper rank her regeneration speed has  significantly waned due to nezuko's  flames which is another testament to how  strong her power really is when tenjin  arrives he points out to tonjro that his  sister is flamboyantly progressing into  a real demon losing her humanity in the  process it's important to state that  nezuko has all this power without ever  devouring a single human which brings us  to the question how powerful could she  become if she started consuming human  blood could she become one of the  strongest upper ranks let us know what  you think in the comments number one  chosen demon despite being a young demon  neziko has displayed great combat  proficiency and skill in battle  overpowering many strong demons nezuko's  accelerated growth also seems to mirror  tangero's own incredible growth rate as  she could take on members of the 12  kazuki and match upper ranked demons in  months however the trait that sets her  apart from all other demons is the fact  that she has the ability to conquer the  sun prompting the demon king to call her  the chosen demon during the battle  against upper rank 4 hontengu nezuko  developed immunity from sunlight a feat  impossible even for the demon lord  himself with this immunity she is able  to walk and go about in the daytime  without being burnt to ash prompting  luzon to shift his goals to hunt and  absorb her to conquer the sun himself  click on this video where we explained  all of tonjiro's forms in demon slayer  don't be shy click it
 

